Cucumber parameter types
{word}
Description: Matches a single word (a sequence of non-space characters).
{string}
Description: Matches a sequence of characters enclosed in quotes (single or double quotes).
{int}
Description: Matches an integer (whole number, positive or negative).
{float}:
Matches a floating-point number (e.g., 3.14, -0.5).
{date}, {datetime}, {time}:
Matches date or time formats (implementation-dependent, often ISO formats



